TI  - Smartphone coaching for glycaemic control in adults with type 2 diabetes: a randomized trial
AU  - Fictional, A.
AU  - Example, B.
PY  - 2024
AB  - We randomized 240 adults with type 2 diabetes to a smartphone coaching app with weekly automated feedback or usual care. At six months HbA1c fell by 0.5 percentage points more in the app group. Engagement was high and no serious adverse events were attributed to the intervention.
