TI  - Effect of a text-message self-management program on HbA1c in adults with type 2 diabetes
AU  - Fictional, C.
PY  - 2023
AB  - Adults with type 2 diabetes in three primary care practices received daily educational text messages for twelve weeks or standard leaflets. The primary outcome was change in HbA1c at three months. The message group improved by 0.4 percentage points relative to control.
