AU  - Example, D.
PY  - 2022
AB  - A web-based education platform with quizzes and goal tracking was compared with a waiting list in 180 adults with type 2 diabetes. HbA1c and fasting glucose were measured at baseline, six and twelve months. Both glycaemic measures improved in the platform group.
