AU  - Fictional, E.
PY  - 2024
AB  - An app guided basal insulin dose adjustments from self-monitored glucose readings in adults with type 2 diabetes starting insulin. Compared with nurse-led telephone titration, the app arm reached target fasting glucose faster and had a similar HbA1c at 24 weeks.
